---
description: Repository test guidance adapter
globs: "Content.Tests/**/*.cs,Content.IntegrationTests/**/*.cs"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use [tests-authoring](../../.agents/skills/tests-authoring/SKILL.md) for test edits and [testing](../../.agents/skills/testing/SKILL.md)/[verification](../../.agents/rules/verification.md) for choosing or running checks. Use the actual existing owner and production boundary. Preserve assertions, user work and [SPDX/Git limits](../../.agents/rules/git-safety.md); [locale policy](../../.agents/rules/content-and-localization.md) owns locale scope. During review assess the reachable regression and evidence; a missing new file is not itself a defect and a review does not authorize execution.
